AdSupport/IdentitySupport products, Auth, Crashlytics, Firebase Messaging and Sentry are not
selected. Automatic collection, IDFV, advertising consent, ad-network registration,
screen reporting and delegate proxying default off; consented Firebase may still
collect automatic device/OS, app-instance and session data. The app checks only
its real Apple Team private Keychain group; ad-hoc builds keep analytics blocked off.
